SUMMARY:Beginner Jewelry Making: Copper Rings
DESCRIPTION:In this beginner ring making class\, students will be taught the basics of cutting\, bending and shaping copper to make your own custom ring. Guided by our teacher Adrian\, each student will craft their own custom ring and leave the class with a finished product. Please note this will be a wrapped or open ring style.
