SUMMARY:Fate & Folklore Presents: Welcome to Dreadful
DESCRIPTION:Summer camp is back. And this time\, the monsters are in charge.\nFate & Folklore invites you to Camp Dreadful\, one day only\, Sunday July 26th from 12 to 5pm. Come as you are\, or come as your creature. Either way\, there’s a craft station with your name on it.\nMeet your counselors:\nDiana\, Kate\, Zatch & Eriana are waiting to welcome you to camp.\nWhat’s happening:\nCraft your own witch bells\nMake a pine cone fire starter\nPaint a river rock (included free for every camper)\nCamp snacks and drinks all afternoon\nShopping in the store\nCostume Contest\nCome in costume and get 20% off your retail purchases. Best costume wins a $25 gift card\, judged by the full counselor crew. \nSpots are limited. Grab your ticket before camp fills up.\nFate & Folklore · 123 Market St\, Downtown Durham\nSunday\, July 26 · 12–5pm\n@fateandfolkloredurham
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fate-folklore-presents-welcome-to-dreadful/
LOCATION:Fate & Folklore\, 123 Market Street\, Durham\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Engagement,Costumes,Craft,Food & Drink,Special Offer
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Camp_dreadful_flyer3.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Fate and Folklore":MAILTO:fateandfolkloredurham@gmail.com
GEO:35.9968012;-78.9021696
