SUMMARY:Trivia Night
DESCRIPTION:Test your knowledge against other Jug drinkers Tuesdays at Glass Jug Downtown for our FREE weekly trivia night. Bring a team of your smartest friends to win prizes! We’ll be alternating weeks between General Knowlege and Music Trivia so there’s something for everyone\, no matter what you’re an expert at. Our Hosts Ash and Wesley will have multiple rounds for you to prove your skills against other teams. So grab a drink and see if you can come out on top! Themes listed in stories each week so stay tuned. \n 
