DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Christmas in July with us at Market on Market! \nJoin us on July 31 from 6:00–9:00 PM for an end-of-month holiday party featuring a spiked hot cocoa bar\, sweet treats\, festive music\, and plenty of Christmas-in-summer fun. \nWear your ugliest Christmas shirt\, bring your friends\, and help us close out July with good vibes and holiday cheer. \nGuests can shop all three businesses\, enjoy seasonal specials\, and take part in a fun evening in downtown Durham. \nMarket on Market\nJuly 31 | 6:00–9:00 PM\nFestive attire encouraged.
